          <p class="project-desc">Full-stack contact form with server-side validation, MySQL storage, and a password-protected admin dashboard.</p>
          <div class="project-tags">
            <span>Node.js</span><span>Express</span><span>EJS</span><span>MySQL</span>
          </div>
